  "source": {
    "name": "bubble.cpp",
    "text": "int numbers[] = {7, 3, 5, 1};\n\nvoid bubble(int (&a)[4]) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < 3; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < 3 - i; ++j) {\n            if (a[j] > a[j + 1]) {\n                int temp = a[j];\n                a[j] = a[j + 1];\n                a[j + 1] = temp;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    bubble(numbers);\n    return numbers[0] == 1 && numbers[3] == 7 ? 0 : 1;\n}\n"
  }
